message: "If you discuss or use this research record, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "sense-correct-abstain: Fixed-budget decision control under angle-dependent coherent bias in QAOA"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Liu"
    given-names: "Zhen-Jun"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Raina-ya/sense-correct-abstain"
version: "1.0.0-mt7-synthesis"
date-released: "2026-11-22"
abstract: >-
  A simulation-first research record studying whether sensing can guide correction
  or abstention under a fixed quantum-execution budget. The frozen route ended at
  Gate 3 FAIL; the repository preserves the negative result, post-lock errata,
  reproducibility checks, and explicit limits on generalization.
keywords:
  - "quantum error mitigation"
  - "QAOA"
  - "randomized compiling"
  - "abstention"
  - "decision theory"
  - "reproducibility"
